{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Description</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unknown gate suddenly opened\u2014and from it poured alien creatures that have seized control of the cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earth is consumed by chaos and fear. You are the final hope of humanity, the one who must reclaim the occupied zones and shut down the gate before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888470/extras/f0e32c1b19879c2c082d38afd7a175d4.poster.avif?t=1753922202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888470/extras/f0e32c1b19879c2c082d38afd7a175d4.webm?t=1753922202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888470/extras/f0e32c1b19879c2c082d38afd7a175d4.mp4?t=1753922202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Reclaim the city, one zone at a time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each area is filled with different enemies and threats. Hunt them down across the city, fight through dynamic battlefields, and take back the zones one by one. Explore immersive map designs and engage enemies in your own unique way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stylish action, satisfying impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience fast-paced, exhilarating hack-and-slash combat. Cut through waves of enemies with stylish combos and explosive impact. Relentless speed and visceral attacks make every moment thrilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888470/extras/fcf10c81326ac562f0c6c050404ec16c.poster.avif?t=1753922202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888470/extras/fcf10c81326ac562f0c6c050404ec16c.webm?t=1753922202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888470/extras/fcf10c81326ac562f0c6c050404ec16c.mp4?t=1753922202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss fights that demand strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bosses are unforgiving. Learn their patterns, find openings, and strike with precision. One mistake can be fatal\u2014caution and timing are your greatest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888470/extras/4f1592551751279e3495c673af8d5fc6.poster.avif?t=1753922202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888470/extras/4f1592551751279e3495c673af8d5fc6.webm?t=1753922202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888470/extras/4f1592551751279e3495c673af8d5fc6.mp4?t=1753922202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You are humanity\u2019s final warrior</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For those who crave stylish combat, powerful feedback, and the thrill of overwhelming odds\u2014this is your battlefield. Step in, fight hard, and become the last hope of Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The demo features a single dungeon where the player defeats patrolling soldiers, gathers items to grow stronger, and ultimately triumphs in a battle against the boss.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888470?t=1753922202","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c